  "step_3": "Comparing the information relevant to the decision reason (variance of the lotteries) with that considered by the individual (probabilities being almost equal and the difference in payouts), it appears the individual did not directly consider variance. The decision reason's rule (preferring the lottery with the larger variance) does not match the individual's justification (preferring the higher payout due to similar probabilities). Therefore, based on the verbal report, it does not seem the individual used the decision reason that prefers the lottery with the larger variance to make their decision.",
